# This is a template showing what sensitive files are ignored
# Copy this to .gitignore if you need to start fresh

# Sensitive documentation files that reveal system architecture:
# - PRD.md, MASTER-PRD.md - Product requirements and specifications
# - ENV_SETUP.md - Environment configuration details
# - STAFF_AUTH_SETUP.md - Authentication setup procedures
# - NOTIFICATION_SETUP.md - Notification service configurations
# - CREATE_ADMIN_VIA_MCP.md - Admin user creation procedures
# - PRODUCTION_READINESS.md - Production deployment information
# - All guide files (ORDER_MANAGEMENT_GUIDE.md, etc.)

# Sensitive scripts:
# - scripts/create-admin-user.* - Admin creation scripts
# - scripts/production-readiness-check.* - System validation scripts

# Planning documents:
# - .cursor/plans/ - Implementation plans
# - .cursorrules - Cursor IDE rules

# These should NOT be committed to version control as they may reveal:
# - System architecture and implementation details
# - Security configurations
# - Deployment procedures
# - Internal testing procedures
